<messaging:emailTemplate subject="{!relatedTo.Id+' - '+relatedTo.Name}" recipientType="User" relatedToType="Opportunity">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<table style="background-color: #0071c5;" width="100%">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding-left: 50px; border: none;">
        <div style="color: white;">
           <h1>Weekly Summary: Opportunities Requiring Updates in Sales CRM</h1>
         </div>
        </td>
        <td style="border: none; padding-right: 20px;" align="right">
        <apex:image url="https://intel--c.na104.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153b000004Pg4i&amp;oid=00Do0000000aRcf" /> 
        </td>
        </tr>
        </tbody>
 </table>
 
Hello {!relatedTo.Owner.Name},<br /><br />
Our records show that several of your opportunities have exceeded the SLA for their current pipeline stage and require updates in Sales CRM.<br />
To help you stay current and maintain pipeline accuracy, we’ve compiled a list of opportunities that may need attention below. Please review each one and update the required fields to ensure they can progress through the pipeline.<br />
<br/>
Opportunities Requiring Action:

[REQUIRED_FIELDS]

<br /><br />
You can view all opportunities currently breaching SLAs in the following report: <a href="[REPORT_LINK]">Report Link</a><br />
This weekly summary is intended as a gentle reminder to help maintain data quality and pipeline visibility.<br />
Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.<br /><br />

Sales Excellence 
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>